  "The board is a grid of squares. Each square has grass or bare ground, and may hold one animal. The board wraps around at the edges.": "棋盘由一格一格的方块组成。每格有草或是空地，并且最多容纳一只动物。棋盘的边缘首尾相连。",
  "<strong>Grass.</strong> Each step, every bare square has a <span data-rule=\"regrow\">4%</span> chance to grow grass. Nothing else spreads it.": "<strong>草。</strong>每一步，每块空地都有<span data-rule=\"regrow\">4%</span>的概率长出草。草没有别的蔓延方式。",
  "<strong>Energy.</strong> Every animal has an energy number. Each step it loses 1 and moves to a neighboring square. At 0 it dies.": "<strong>能量。</strong>每只动物都有一个能量值。每一步它会失去1点能量，并移到相邻的一格。降到0就会死。",
  "<strong>Rabbits</strong> move onto grass next to them if there is any, and otherwise to any free square. Eating grass gives <span data-rule=\"rabbit.eat\">6</span> energy. At <span data-rule=\"rabbit.splitAt\">12</span> a rabbit splits in two.": "<strong>兔子</strong>会优先走向旁边的草，没有草就走到任意空格。吃一份草得到<span data-rule=\"rabbit.eat\">6</span>点能量。能量到<span data-rule=\"rabbit.splitAt\">12</span>时，兔子一分为二。",
  "<strong>Foxes</strong> do the same with rabbits. Eating a rabbit gives <span data-rule=\"fox.eat\">4</span> energy, and a fox splits at <span data-rule=\"fox.splitAt\">24</span>.": "<strong>狐狸</strong>对兔子也是如此。吃一只兔子得到<span data-rule=\"fox.eat\">4</span>点能量，狐狸在<span data-rule=\"fox.splitAt\">24</span>点时分裂。",
  "<strong>The cycle.</strong> Rabbits boom, foxes follow, the rabbits run out, the foxes starve, and it starts again. Each line on the chart is scaled to its own highest point.": "<strong>循环。</strong>兔子激增，狐狸随后增多，兔子被吃光，狐狸饿死，然后一切重新开始。图表上每条线都按它自己的最高点缩放。"
